          "text": "Urinary symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Nocturia 2–3 times; mild hesitancy. Denies dysuria, fever, urinary retention, and haematuria."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
