        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mobility and stair tolerance"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports difficulty climbing two flights of stairs, especially carrying groceries, with significant pain and multiple stops. Reports difficulty walking more than 100 m without resting due to back and hip pain. Mobilises independently without gait aids; sometimes leans on furniture when pain is bad. No recent falls reported."
      }
    },
    {
